<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds ($206 million) for auction on February 12 and issue on February 13, when 91-day bills worth 769.550 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.995 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
